#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Embewi Core — Documentation"
msgstr "Embewi Core — Documentation"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"**Embewi Core** est le contrôleur Kubernetes qui pilote des MCU "
"(microcontrôleurs) connectés via le [contrat "
"`v1alpha1`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi). Il gère le cycle de vie "
"des firmwares (OTA), la configuration runtime et l'exposition des devices"
" comme endpoints routables dans le cluster."
msgstr ""
"**Embewi Core** is the Kubernetes controller that drives connected MCUs "
"(microcontrollers) via the [`v1alpha1` "
"contract](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi). It manages firmware "
"lifecycle (OTA), runtime configuration, and exposes devices as routable "
"endpoints inside the cluster."

#: ../../index.md:8
msgid ""
"L'implémentation agent actuelle cible ESP32/ESP-IDF, mais le contrat "
"`v1alpha1` est indépendant du matériel — tout MCU capable de parler HTTPS"
" peut être supporté."
msgstr ""
"The current agent implementation targets ESP32/ESP-IDF, but the "
"`v1alpha1` contract is hardware-independent — any MCU capable of "
"speaking HTTPS can be supported."

